OL,3,GNEWSADance teacher charged with child
OL,4,Asexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with child
OL,7,Fsexual offences in Staffordshire.
OL,9,FWarren Bullock, a dance teacher from
OL,10,FLower Penn, near Wolverhampton, who
OL,11,Fstarred in Netflix documentary Baby
OL,12,FBallroom, is accused of causing or
OL,13,Finciting a boy aged 13 to 15 to engage
OL,14,Fin sexual activity.
OL,16,FIt followed an investigation by
OL,17,Fofficers from the Police Online
OL,18,FInvestigations Team into a report of
OL,19,Fsexual communication with a child,
OL,20,FStaffordshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
