OL,4,Asexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 61-year-old accused, who is also
OL,7,Fcharged with sexual assault on a male,
OL,8,Fhas been bailed to appear before
OL,9,FCannock Magistrates' Court on 16
OL,10,FOctober.
